.TH TEXT_LOAD_FONT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
text_load_font \- Load a TrueType font from assets/ at the given point size
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtext.h\(dq
.BI "Font text_load_font(const char *relative_path, float pt);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load a TrueType font from assets/ at the given point size. Requires ENGINE_WITH_TTF and EngineConfig.text = true.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the Font, or a zero Font on failure (logged); a zero Font draws with the 8px debug font, ignoring the size.
.SH MODULE
text (src/engine/text/text.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR text_draw (3),
.BR text_size (3),
.BR gge\-assets (7),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
